<Base title="About" description="About Alex Szczygielski — backend engineer in training.">
  <div class="container page-container">
    <div class="prose">
      <h1>About</h1>

      <p>
        I'm a developer with a strong interest in <strong>backend engineering</strong>,
        <strong>DevOps</strong>, and <strong>cybersecurity/cloud</strong> infrastructure.
        I learn by doing — setting up homelab environments, digging into how systems
        actually work, and writing about the hard parts.
      </p>

      <p>
        This blog is where I document real problems I've run into and how I solved them.
        No fluff — just the issue, the process, and what I learned.
      </p>

      <h2>What I'm focused on</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Backend</strong> — Java, Spring Boot, REST APIs, system design</li>
        <li><strong>DevOps / Cloud</strong> — Docker, Linux, CI/CD pipelines, AWS</li>
        <li><strong>Cybersecurity</strong> — CTF challenges, network fundamentals, security hardening</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Stack</h2>
      <table>
        <thead><tr><th>Area</th><th>Tools</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td>Languages</td><td>Java, Python, Bash</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Backend</td><td>Spring Boot, REST APIs</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Infrastructure</td><td>Docker, Linux, Git, GitHub Actions</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Cloud</td><td>AWS (learning), self-hosted homelab</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Tools</td><td>IntelliJ, Vim, Wireshark</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>

      <h2>Links</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><a href="https://github.com/AlexSzczygielski" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub — AlexSzczygielski</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/aleksander-szczygielski-505821367/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LinkedIn</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</Base>
